            "notes": "Now with everyone fully powered the weapon power attack speed healing is just not going to be enough. We will shift our strategy to supporting our team in confirming kills and saving them from death. The main way we will be doing this is with the Swift Step and Suzu combo. Swift Step will apply a strong heal over time on everyone near our target and the Suzu will ensure the time necessary for the HoT to do its thing. Pepper in your Ofuda and our teammate will be getting toped off with 160 Overhealth, 45% attack speed and 25% movement speed, perfect for confirming those pivotal kills!\n\nOur survivability also skyrockets with this AP switch. With Suzu our health will be over 600 and the attack speed will  keep us alive with benefit Self-Care. Our cooldown rate should be near 30% allowing us to get in, save our teammate and get out with tons of life, healing, over health and a Low cooldown Swift Step to get out or to our next teammate.",
